WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:07.633
Tell me about yourself.

00:00:08.217 --> 00:00:09.551
Everything is fine.

00:00:11.345 --> 00:00:13.347
How's the situation with your sister?

00:00:14.056 --> 00:00:14.681
Fine.

00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:16.517
And how's work?

00:00:17.309 --> 00:00:18.143
It's fine.

00:00:23.065 --> 00:00:26.443
You know what word I'm getting
a little tired of hearing from you, Marty?

00:00:27.528 --> 00:00:28.362
The "F" word.

00:00:30.322 --> 00:00:32.783
♪ I don't need you to worry for me ♪

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:35.160
♪ 'Cause I'm all right ♪

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.412
Everything is not fine.

00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:39.289
You're a nice guy.

00:00:39.373 --> 00:00:41.124
I'm not gonna let anyone use you.

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:43.210
Therapy works.

00:00:43.752 --> 00:00:44.795
It's empowering.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:46.171
It's liberating.

00:00:46.505 --> 00:00:47.965
I feel like I'm on drugs.

00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:49.842
I mean, I've never
taken them before, but...

00:00:49.925 --> 00:00:52.135
I mean, I assume
this is what drugs feel like.

00:00:52.469 --> 00:00:55.097
♪ I don't care what you say anymore ♪

00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:56.890
♪ This is my life ♪

00:00:57.015 --> 00:00:58.642
Doctor's a little unconventional.

00:00:58.725 --> 00:00:59.601
I don't trust him.

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:02.104
♪ Go ahead with your own life ♪

00:01:02.187 --> 00:01:03.272
♪ Leave me alone ♪

00:01:04.648 --> 00:01:06.984
Marty, I have your
best interest at heart,

00:01:09.403 --> 00:01:10.696
but without trust,

00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:13.323
we have nothing.

00:01:13.407 --> 00:01:14.408
I do trust you.

00:01:14.867 --> 00:01:16.243
I trust you completely.

00:01:19.288 --> 00:01:22.291
I do believe you have just had
what we headshrinkers call

00:01:22.708 --> 00:01:23.584
a breakthrough.

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:25.878
Oh, Jesus.

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:27.379
And we're out of time.

00:01:27.546 --> 00:01:29.214
Oh.

00:01:29.298 --> 00:01:30.174
♪ Leave me alone ♪

